namespace Veriqa.Core.ChannelAdapter.UI;

/// <summary>
/// Color scheme of the pages generated by the core (SPEC-015 §2.2) — the value a level of the
/// configuration states. It controls the <c>data-theme</c> attribute on <c>&lt;html&gt;</c> of the
/// sign-in window and of every service page alike; the attribute value itself is derived by
/// <see cref="CorePageBrandingRules.EffectiveTheme"/>.
/// <para>
/// The enum lives here rather than in the auth server because its consumers do: the service pages
/// of the contour, three of which belong to the email adapter, and this assembly cannot reference
/// the auth server.
/// </para>
/// </summary>
public enum AuthPageTheme
{
    /// <summary>
    /// Follows the user's system setting (prefers-color-scheme). Default value.
    /// </summary>
    Auto,

    /// <summary>
    /// Light (white) theme.
    /// </summary>
    Light,

    /// <summary>
    /// Dark theme.
    /// </summary>
    Dark
}
